	"Consumers": [],
	"Description": "Gravwell Okta kit health. Fires if Okta stops serializing target objects as {\"id\",\"type\",\"alternateId\",\"displayName\",...}, which the kit relies on to pick the user and app acted on. Intended for the Gravwell administrator, not the security team. Enabled by default.\n\nNo consumers are attached. Next step after install: add a consumer flow to this alert (email, Slack, Teams, webhook, Jira, ...) to route it where your team works. Alert events are also written to the shared _alerts tag (Contents._vendor is Okta), so you can search them without a consumer. Each producer is a scheduled search; disable a producer to turn off one detection without turning off the alert.",
